to: sauce-chef
topic: savory-menu

Read docs/menu-direction.md for the full shared direction, constraints, and
pantry before starting.

Deliver:
1. 11 savory a la carte dishes for Ember & Olive (Mediterranean coastal,
   wood-fire/hearth focused). Respect the protein-repeat limit (max 2 dishes
   per primary protein) and the olive oil / wood-fire constraints.
2. Savory tasting menu courses 1-6 (light/raw to rich), building toward the
   dessert course that pastry-chef will add as course 7. Do not repeat any
   a la carte dish exactly in the tasting menu.
3. Every dish must include: name, short description, primary components,
   cooking method, accompanying sauce/condiment, nut-allergy label, and
   vegetarian flag where applicable.

No em dashes. Return your recipes in the standard envelope so recipe-tester
can evaluate them next.
